/-!
# The design C anchor-move lists and the common denominator of the moved row polynomials (G30)

The lists `aL0, aL1, vL0, vL1` are the integer numerators over `DH = 2^40` of the design C trial
sequences (`tr4-uC160-24.64`, K = 160, rounded to `2^-40`); `movSeq l DH` is the sequence `k |-> l_{k-1}/DH`.
`hMov0`, `hMov1` are the move increments `h0 = -2 T(da0) - S(dv0)` and `h0 + h1` as `(refT wT + refS wS)/DH`.

kcost: 161 modulo operations of a 231-bit integer, 0.05 s estimated.
-/

